# (80.49.210.251 as of 2026-08-29, Orange PL). Pinned as an IP as well as being
# listed in allowed-domains.list: DuckDNS is *dynamic*, so a residential-IP
# change silently breaks it until init-firewall.sh is rerun (which re-resolves
# the domain). Same network as the LAN entry 192.168.1.102 above.
